      "description": "Watch Defensa Y Justicia vs Aldosivi highlights and goals from Argentine Primera División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 24, 2026. On July 24, 2026, Defensa y Justicia and Aldosivi squared off in a pivotal Liga Profesional Argentina fixture, with both sides looking to make their mark on the league standings through disciplined football. Taking the initiative The match opened with high intensity, but it was Defensa y Justicia who capitalized on their momentum early on. In the 16th minute, Nicolas Cordero broke the deadlock, firing home after receiving a clinical assist from Tomas Fernandez . The momentum continued to swing in favor of the hosts, as David Barbona added a second goal in the 29th minute, effectively taking control of the game’s narrative before the referee signaled for half time. Managing the lead The second half saw a more fragmented game as both teams battled for control in the center of the pitch. Disciplinary issues began to surface, with the referee issuing yellow cards to Cesar Perez and Agustin Hausch for the home side, and to Tomas Fernandez and Blas Palavecino for the visitors. Despite a flurry of substitutions from both benches—including late appearances from Andres Chavez and Domingo Blanco —the defensive lines held firm. The final whistle confirmed a professional victory built on the back of an inspired first-half performance."
